<title>JAPAN: Nissan Aug domestic output down 13.3% y/y.</title>
<headline>Nissan Aug domestic output down 13.3% y/y.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nissan Motor Co Ltd said on Friday that its domestic vehicle production, exports, domestic sales and overseas output in August were as follows (with percentage changes from a year earlier):</p>
<p> Production	  100,867  down 13.3 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		88,403  down 14.6 percent</p>
<p>- Trucks &amp; Buses  12,464  down  3.2 percent</p>
<p>---</p>
<p> Exports		41,095  down 19.8 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		34,844  down 24.6 percent</p>
<p>  - Trucks &amp; Buses   6,251  up   24.4 percent</p>
<p>---</p>
<p> Domestic sales     55,386  down  3.3 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		40,479  down 10.1 percent</p>
<p>  - Trucks &amp; Buses  14,907  up   21.7 percent</p>
<p>---</p>
<p> Overseas output    84,351  up   12.3 percent</p>
</text>
